---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="terms-container">
    <div class="terms-content">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="last-updated">Last updated: July 2025</div>

      <div class="intro">
        <p>
          At LinguaTech, we care deeply about your privacy. This Privacy Policy
          explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information in
          connection with the LinguaLoop mobile application ("App"). By using
          LinguaLoop, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy. Terms used
          here that are not defined have the meaning given in our <a
            href="/lingualoop/terms-of-use">Terms and Conditions</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect the following types of personal information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Name and Email Address:</strong> Collected through Apple Sign-In
            to create and manage your account.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>User ID:</strong> A unique identifier associated with your account,
            used internally to manage your profile and app data.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Purchase History:</strong> Subscription data (monthly or annual),
            including plan type and status, used to manage access to paid content.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Gameplay Content:</strong> Responses generated during language
            activities (e.g., dictation or quizzes) are stored and analyzed to improve
            learning outcomes.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Product Interaction:</strong> Usage events (e.g., app opened,
            activity completed) are collected to understand general app usage and
            improve the experience.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Customer Support:</strong> If you contact us, we store any details
            you provide in order to respond and assist you effectively.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not collect passwords or payment card data. Subscription
          payments are processed via Apple.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your personal data to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Authenticate and manage your user account</li>
          <li>Enable access to free or premium content</li>
          <li>
            Analyze usage patterns to improve features and content difficulty
          </li>
          <li>Provide customer support</li>
          <li>Monitor technical performance and usage trends</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not use your data for marketing or advertising purposes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>3. Advertising and Tracking</h2>
        <p>
          We do not use your personal information for advertising, tracking, or
          data brokerage. We do not engage in cross-app tracking or share user
          data with advertising platforms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>4. How We Collect Information</h2>
        <p>We collect information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Directly from you when you create an account or contact us</li>
          <li>Automatically through the app (e.g., device and usage data)</li>
          <li>
            From third-party platforms (e.g., Apple) when authorized by you
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          We use Supabase as our backend service provider. Supabase handles user
          authentication, data storage, and analytics infrastructure. All user
          data is securely stored on Supabase servers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>6. Sharing Your Information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell or rent your personal data. We only share it:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            With service providers under strict data processing agreements
            (e.g., for analytics or infrastructure hosting)
          </li>
          <li>When required by law or in legal proceedings</li>
          <li>With your consent or at your request</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain your personal data only as long as necessary to provide the
          service or as required by applicable law. Upon deletion of your
          account, we will securely delete or anonymize your personal data
          within 30 days unless legal retention obligations apply.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may request to access, correct, or delete your personal data at
          any time. To do so, contact us at <a
            href="mailto:contact@linguatech.app">contact@linguatech.app</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>9. Security Measures</h2>
        <p>
          We rely on Supabase, our backend infrastructure provider, to implement
          industry-standard security measures including secure server
          infrastructure, encrypted data transmission, and access controls.
          While we rely on trusted third-party providers and follow best
          practices, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>10. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          This app is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not
          knowingly collect personal data from children. If we become aware of
          such data, we will delete it immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>11. International Users</h2>
        <p>
          Your data is processed and stored in secure data centers operated by
          our service providers, including Supabase, which may be located in
          jurisdictions outside of your country of residence. These locations
          may not have the same data protection laws as your home country. By
          using LinguaLoop, you consent to the transfer of your data to these
          jurisdictions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in our practices
          or legal obligations. We will notify you of material changes through
          the App or by other means. The date of the last update is posted at
          the top of this document.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-section">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy,
          please contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="contact-info">
          <p>
            <strong>Email:</strong>
            <a href="mailto:contact@linguatech.app">contact@linguatech.app</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <p
          style="text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem; font-style: italic; color: #6b7280;"
        >
          We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring a safe user
          experience.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .terms-content {
    text-align: left;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .last-updated {
    text-align: center;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .intro {
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .terms-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .terms-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .terms-section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .terms-section ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .terms-section li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .terms-section strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .contact-section {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .contact-info {
    background: #f0f9ff;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-info p {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-info strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
  }

  a {
    color: #3b82f6;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .terms-container {
      margin: 1rem;
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .terms-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
